Allow `vpk [osx] pack` to run on a Linux host (Velopack 1.2.161).

Upstream only registers the macOS `pack` command on macOS. This registers it everywhere,
creates the portable zip with `zip` instead of `ditto`, and signs/notarizes with rcodesign
when not on macOS (APPLE_CERT_P12, APPLE_CERT_PASSWORD, APPLE_NOTARY_API_KEY, VPK_RCODESIGN).
Use with --noInst; the installer .pkg needs macOS tools.

Apply to a 1.2.161 source tree with: git apply macos-on-linux.patch
---
